hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"162","[AI-translation] Mtu anapomtembelea ndugu yake Muislamu mgonjwa, hutembea bustanini mwa Pepo hadi aketi; akikaa, rehema humfunika. Akienda asubuhi, malaika elfu sabini humswalia hadi jioni; akienda jioni, malaika elfu sabini humswalia hadi asubuhi. [Fadhila ya kumtembelea mgonjwa]"
